                "description": "The Norwich Knob with Arched Rose is an unassuming knobset that fits neatly in with traditional decor. It is a great accent piece, finishing up a room with quiet beauty. The Traditional Norwich Door Knob with Arched #8 Rose is available in an array of classic finishes and some more modern ones too. This half round door knob is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n",
